  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AU JFA kapacitetsst&#xf6;d</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AU capacity building -institutional transformation - AU JFA capacity building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AUs institutionella transformations program (ITP) inneh&#xe5;ller en m&#xe4;ngd reformer (t.ex. finansiell och HR ledningssystem, kommunikationer) som syftar till att st&#xe4;rka AUCs institutionella kapacitet. M&#xe5;ls&#xe4;ttningen &#xe4;r effektiva administrativa system och processer som g&#xf6;r att AUC kan utf&#xf6;ra sitt mandat. St&#xf6;det ges genom en gemensamt avtal med andra givare (JFA).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Institutional Transformation Process (ITP) is a set of reforms (e.g.financial and human resource management, communication  infrastructure) owned by the AUC that aim to address the core concerns related to its institutional capacity. The outcome of the ITP is effective core business processes within the AUC that allow for efficient and effective management of resources.</narrative>
  </description>
